[Desktop Entry]
Version=1.0
Name=Cyrethium Conky Manager
Comment=Manage and configure Conky widgets
Comment[tr]=Conky widget’larını yönet ve yapılandır
Comment[es]=Gestiona y configura los widgets de Conky
Comment[fr]=Gérez et configurez les widgets Conky
Comment[de]=Conky-Widgets verwalten und konfigurieren
Comment[ar]=إدارة وتكوين عناصر Conky
Comment[ru]=Управление и настройка виджетов Conky
Comment[zh]=管理和配置 Conky 小部件
Comment[ja]=Conky ウィジェットを管理および構成
Comment[ko]=Conky 위젯 관리 및 구성
Comment[pt]=Gerencie e configure os widgets do Conky
Comment[it]=Gestisci e configura i widget di Conky
Comment[nl]=Beheer en configureer Conky-widgets
Comment[sv]=Hantera och konfigurera Conky-widgets
Comment[pl]=Zarządzaj i konfiguruj widgety Conky
Exec=mate-terminal -- bash -c "sudo /usr/local/bin/conky-manager; exec bash"
Terminal=true
Type=Application
Icon=/usr/share/icons/cyrethium/terminal.png
Categories=System;
StartupNotify=false
